hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16763","He said: Yahya ibn Said narrated to us, from Shuba, he said: Yahya ibn Husayn ibn Urwa narrated to us, he said: my grandmother narrated to me, she said: I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say: Even if a slave is appointed over you leading you by the Book of Allah, mighty and majestic, listen to him and obey."
"16764","He said: Waki narrated to us, he said: Shuba narrated to us, from Yahya ibn Husayn, from his grandmother, she said: I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say: May Allah have mercy on those shaving, may Allah have mercy on those shaving; they said in the third: and those shortening; he said: and those shortening."
